times are ******* atrocious. PvE (Operations) lobby and matchmaking are painfully slow and redundant. When matchmaking breaks, I have to go back to the title screen to try again. Cannot give a perfect score for this reason. PLEASE FIX MATCHMAKING", "timestamp_created": 1734299919, "timestamp_updated": 1734299919, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182850634", "author": {"steamid": "76561197994997019", "personaname": "Wardude86", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197994997019/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 2084, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 974, "last_played": 1765166179, "avatar": "403bd44e1050e13a9ca1d320029474dacc616d70"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great Game and good introduction to the world of Warhammer 40k!", "timestamp_created": 1734299274, "timestamp_updated": 1734299274, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182850458", "author": {"steamid": "76561199141855599", "personaname": "3xV", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/3xVVV/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 55, "playtime_forever": 2273, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1609, "last_played": 1734495666, "avatar": "48b7dd4a46bb7fa11ad9f35fcb9a6e9a581b387b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Campaign was actually really fun and operations seem to have quite a lot of content to progress in. Overall I really enjoyed space marine 2 despite it being my first 40k game.", "timestamp_created": 1734299102, "timestamp_updated": 1734299102, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.524802029132843018", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182850070", "author": {"steamid": "76561197992671557", "personaname": "VGFX", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/vorge/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 835, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 835, "last_played": 1734298581, "avatar": "51af64859b1d47f7cfe9dd96f062973adc60daf5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Warhammer 40k has one of the most badass universes in all science fiction. This game captures it perfectly. I look forward to Space Marine 3.", "timestamp_created": 1734298727, "timestamp_updated": 1734298727, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182849756", "author": {"steamid": "76561198075203093", "personaname": "Michael Myers", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Michaelmyers85/", "num_games_owned": 682, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 1174, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 969, "last_played": 1764857792, "avatar": "36ac8646223d2cdb1b9336ffc9e9b392baca0551"}, "language": "english", "review": "While Astro Bot was great and deserved GOTY to some, Space Marine 2 is my GOTY of 2024. Very well made and got me into Warhammer!", "timestamp_created": 1734298436, "timestamp_updated": 1734298436, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182849453", "author": {"steamid": "76561198107347946", "personaname": "MAZAKU556", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198107347946/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 798, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 566, "last_played": 1736308383, "avatar": "14f1a9927382fa8dea134a0f3ca6f17e6938e131"}, "language": "english", "review": "for the emporer", "timestamp_created": 1734298154, "timestamp_updated": 1734298154, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182849223", "author": {"steamid": "76561198806564677", "personaname": "UnwashedFreya", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198806564677/", "num_games_owned": 60, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 815, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 815, "last_played": 1734296884, "avatar": "f2eca8d585fdc2d0d5e7abd8c22437506a89642c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Core gameloop as a player lacks fluidity. Feels clunky and very little diversity. Gears of war came out almost 20 years ago and it feels more fluid to play. \r\n\r\nEnemies are one thing they got partly-right. Fighting Tyranid swarms feels awesome. Boss-like characters just feel like hitting sandbags and dodging. Like an unpolished dark souls game or monster hunter. \r\n\r\nHas the annoying characteristics of many popular western games, super \"hand-holdy\", long periods of time where the player has no agency and just has to listen to dialogue, main character's completely lack personality. \r\n\r\nAlthough private lobbies exist(They didn't exist on release) matchmaking is poorly implemented. If you want to play as a specific class you like when you matchmake you have to cross your fingers and hope the lobby you are joining hasn't already picked that class, otherwise you're forced to pick a different class. Whoever didn't allow for class based matchmaking or allow the same class to be picked in the same lobby should be fired. \r\n\r\nHandling XP based on completing a mission instead of actually playing the game is also a poor design choice. Sprinting through the mission and not playing should not be the most optimal way to farm XP.", "timestamp_created": 1734297942, "timestamp_updated": 1734297942, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47350621223449707", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182847892", "author": {"steamid": "76561198359906870", "personaname": "RHYS-_-", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198359906870/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 4649, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 48, "playtime_at_review": 1756, "last_played": 1788797224, "avatar": "e123051ffc4f07e73737d58c17e3bee71366fc34"}, "language": "english", "review": "I love me some Xeno genocide.", "timestamp_created": 1734296684, "timestamp_updated": 1734296684, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.46875", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "ap